00000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "• Within growth forms, years and (if prosont) interactions, values followed by same letter are not significantly different at P ≤ 0.10.", "bbox": {"x": 366.36348196388434, "y": 1219.065277854079, "width": 889.2941868208809, "height": 57.48160878817232}}, {"kind": "list", "text": "Between wood residue rate and either or both N fortilization regime or gypsum regime; no significant three-way interactions among residue, fertilization and gypsum treatments occured. Values are means among 3 rates of initial N fertilization applied in 1981.", "bbox": {"x": 366.15146628002026, "y": 1297.3669345429662, "width": 857.8277443939785, "height": 150.56962649027503}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gypsum Amendment Effects", "bbox": {"x": 119.13747020215618, "y": 1498.7499994652778, "width": 380.3234501347709, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Gypsum was surface-applied as an amendment", "bbox": {"x": 169.54177860237598, "y": 1567.4999999801953, "width": 614.0161725067387, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "treatment in April of 1987.", "bbox": {"x": 119.13746960646888, "y": 1599.5833330125, "width": 412.39892183288407, "height": 32.083333333333464}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Therefore, data", "bbox": {"x": 559.0296493665769, "y": 1604.1666666380208, "width": 219.9460916442048, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "collected in", "bbox": {"x": 119.13746606119597, "y": 1636.2499999490744, "width": 187.87061994609164, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1988,", "bbox": {"x": 302.42587570080866, "y": 1636.2499999056374, "width": 114.55525606469004, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "1989, and 1990 reflect", "bbox": {"x": 416.98113174453425, "y": 1631.6666666327162, "width": 366.5768194070081, "height": 36.66666666666678}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "responses 1, 2, and 3 years after treatment application, respectively.", "bbox": {"x": 118.66871402717594, "y": 1663.6536340553093, "width": 665.1473628864136, "height": 75.9449970722198}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Soils data of Meining", "bbox": {"x": 471.6697459700566, "y": 1696.8135414025205, "width": 312.3141676910483, "height": 36.06081008911133}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(1991)", "bbox": {"x": 119.1374660638477, "y": 1737.0833332473958, "width": 96.22641509433963, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "demonstrated", "bbox": {"x": 233.69272403301886, "y": 1737.0833329895831, "width": 206.1994609164421, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "reductions in", "bbox": {"x": 444.47439326204153, "y": 1737.0833332079558, "width": 206.19946091644195, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "sodicity", "bbox": {"x": 669.0026952955975, "y": 1737.0833332416667, "width": 109.97304582210245, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "(exchangeable Na, ESP and SAR) and evidence of increased Na leaching in the upper 30 cm of gypsum-amended spoils during the 1988-1990 period.", "bbox": {"x": 118.21196390623953, "y": 1765.1795475593874, "width": 670.5908700783618, "height": 133.09190471967045}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "grasses and non-seeded annual forbs responded positively to gypsum amendment within the first 14 months after application in 1988 [see Table 3), although gypsum responses were confounded somewhat by a two-way interaction with Nfertilization.", "bbox": {"x": 875.2021563243196, "y": 1498.7499999493077, "width": 664.4204851752022, "height": 197.08333333333337}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "More clearly positive effects of", "bbox": {"x": 1063.0727760580182, "y": 1668.3333333197195, "width": 476.54986522911054, "height": 27.4999999999999}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "gypsum on herbaceous", "bbox": {"x": 874.6721016579071, "y": 1696.479953878307, "width": 372.10520824010786, "height": 39.63964223861709}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "species productivity", "bbox": {"x": 1250.9433959817716, "y": 1704.9999999766949, "width": 288.6792452830188, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "emerged in 1989 and 1990.", "bbox": {"x": 874.739675035758, "y": 1728.4520933963995, "width": 390.21460849319845, "height": 39.03712511062627}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "This may have been", "bbox": {"x": 1260.1078164420487, "y": 1737.0833333063724, "width": 284.0970350404313, "height": 27.500000000000146}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "due to the passage of additional time for fuller expression of gypsum's ameliorative effects on spoil sodicity. Gypsum has been noted to require more time for effectiveness than certain other inorganic amendments due to its relatively lower", "bbox": {"x": 875.2021561250439, "y": 1769.1666666536114, "width": 669.0026954177897, "height": 164.99999999999991}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Aboveground biomass of seeded perennial", "bbox": {"x": 169.54178019766394, "y": 1934.1666661319443, "width": 614.0161725067386, "height": 32.08333333333322}}, {"kind": "text", "text": "Pagc 408", "bbox": {"x": 782.9599438028321, "y": 2114.192526881792, "width": 134.320075556917, "height": 34.33211167653405}}], "ms": 372.761958}